@startuml US10

participant Student
participant Browser
participant Model
participant Database

Student -> Browser : Recieve reserved food item
Browser -> Model : Notify completed reservation
Model -> Student : Request feedback
Student -> Browser : Submit feedback w/ email
Browser -> Model : Pass feedback and email
Model -> Database : Check email against existing records

alt email exists
    Database -> Model : Return existing record
    Model -> Browser : Notify feedback submission failed
    Browser -> Student : Notify feedback submission failed
else email does not exist
    Database -> Model : Return no record found
    Model -> Database : Store feedback and email
    Database -> Model : Return success
    Model -> Browser : Notify feedback submission successful
    Browser -> Student : Send thank you message
end


@enduml